<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He ever lives above</l><l>For me to intercede,</l><l>His all-redeeming love,</l><l>His precious blood to plead.</l><l>His blood was shed for all our race,</l><l>And sprinkles now the throne of grace.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Five bleeding wounds He bears,</l><l>Received on Calvary;</l><l>They pour effectual prayers;</l><l>They strongly speak for me.</l><l>Forgive him, O forgive, they cry,</l><l>Nor let that ransomed sinner die!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Father hears Him pray,</l><l>His dear anointed One;</l><l>He cannot turn away</l><l>The presence of His Son.</l><l>His Spirit answers to the blood,</l><l>And tells me I am born of God.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>To God I’m reconciled,</l><l>His pardoning voice I hear;</l><l>He owns me for His child,</l><l>I can no longer fear.</l><l>With confidence I now draw nigh,</l><l>And Father, Abba, Father, cry.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
